# Built-in LG apps hidden from the app manager by 60-slim (RAM-only overlay with
# whiteouts over the app folders, then the app manager restart rescans them).
# The firmware is untouched; remove a line (or the file) and reboot to restore.
#
# Kept on purpose (do NOT add): com.palm.app.settings, livetv, hdmi1-4,
# inputcommon, externalinput.*, screensaver (DVD saver hooks it), notificationcenter (Homebrew failsafe toast), webapphost,
# oobe/firstuse/eula (needed after a reset), factorywin (service menu), tvhotkey
# (TV's physical buttons), installation/channelsetting/channeledit/livemenu/
# dvrpopup/scheduler (live TV), remotesetting/connectionwizard (remote pairing),
# btsurroundautotuning (Bluetooth kept on), softwareupdate, photovideo/music/
# tvsimpleviewer/systemmusic (USB media), onetouchsoundtuning, self-diagnosis.

